    73	/**Function*************************************************************
    74	
    75	  Synopsis    [Runs the stmap97 mode-3-free sticky emitted-AIG drive/load target probe.]
    76	
    77	  Description [stmap97 keeps the relaxed final-critical emitted AIG/phase
    78	  target sticky during earlier recovery but disables the sticky veto during
    79	  mode-3 phase-aware recovery, testing whether final phase-aware freedom
    80	  recovers the stmap94 or1200 timing.]
    81	
    82	  SideEffects []
    83	
    84	  SeeAlso     []
    85	
    86	***********************************************************************/
